[
  {"id":"logic_q_560","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":2,"grade_max":4,"difficulty":1,"tags":["logic","spatial","正方体展开图"],"subject":"logic","stem":"正方体有几个面？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"4个"},{"label":"B","text":"5个"},{"label":"C","text":"6个"},{"label":"D","text":"8个"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"正方体有6个面（上、下、前、后、左、右），12条棱，8个顶点。","hint":"数数骰子有几个面。","time_limit_seconds":20,"points":10,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_561","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":3,"grade_max":5,"difficulty":2,"tags":["logic","spatial","正方体展开图"],"subject":"logic","stem":"正方体的展开图由几个正方形组成？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"4个"},{"label":"B","text":"5个"},{"label":"C","text":"6个"},{"label":"D","text":"8个"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"正方体有6个面，展开后就是6个正方形拼在一起。但不是任意6个正方形的排列都能折成正方体，展开图有11种不同的形式。","hint":"有几个面就有几个正方形。","time_limit_seconds":20,"points":10,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_562","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":4,"grade_max":6,"difficulty":3,"tags":["logic","spatial","正方体展开图"],"subject":"logic","stem":"十字形展开图（中间一列4个，第2行左右各1个）能折成正方体吗？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"能"},{"label":"B","text":"不能"},{"label":"C","text":"缺少一个面"},{"label":"D","text":"多出一个面"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"十字形展开图是最经典的正方体展开图之一。中间4个格子折成上、前、下、后四个面，左右两个格子折成左、右面。","hint":"数一数十字形有几个格子。","time_limit_seconds":30,"points":10,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_563","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":5,"grade_max":7,"difficulty":3,"tags":["logic","spatial","正方体展开图"],"subject":"logic","stem":"正方体展开图中，哪两个面折起后是相对的面？T形展开图（上面一排3个，下面正中1个，再下面2个），最上面一行中间的格子和哪个格子相对？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"最下面一行左边的格子"},{"label":"B","text":"最下面正中的格子"},{"label":"C","text":"T形最下面一行右边的格子"},{"label":"D","text":"上面一行左边的格子"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"在展开图中，两个格子如果折起来后恰好在对面，中间隔了一个格子（不能直接相邻）。通过实际折叠可以验证。","hint":"相对的面中间至少隔一个格子。","time_limit_seconds":60,"points":15,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_564","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":6,"grade_max":8,"difficulty":4,"tags":["logic","spatial","正方体展开图"],"subject":"logic","stem":"正方体展开图一共有多少种不同的形式？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"6种"},{"label":"B","text":"8种"},{"label":"C","text":"11种"},{"label":"D","text":"15种"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"正方体展开图共有11种不同的形式。这是经过数学证明的。可以按照中间列的长度分类：4-1-1型、3-2-1型、3-1-2型、2-2-2型等。","hint":"这个数字比你想象的可能多一些。","time_limit_seconds":30,"points":15,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_565","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":7,"grade_max":9,"difficulty":5,"tags":["logic","spatial","正方体展开图"],"subject":"logic","stem":"下面哪个展开图不能折成正方体？A:一行排列6个格子 B:十字形 C:T形 D:L形加一格","options":[{"label":"A","text":"A（一行6个）"},{"label":"B","text":"B（十字形）"},{"label":"C","text":"C（T形）"},{"label":"D","text":"D（L形加一格）"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"一行排列6个格子不能折成正方体——折起来后有两个面会重叠。正方体展开图中，任意一排最多只能有4个连续格子。","hint":"尝试想象把一行6个格子折起来会怎样。","time_limit_seconds":45,"points":20,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_566","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":2,"grade_max":4,"difficulty":1,"tags":["logic","spatial","积木阴影"],"subject":"logic","stem":"一个正方体放在地上，从正上方看（俯视图）是什么形状？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"正方形"},{"label":"B","text":"长方形"},{"label":"C","text":"三角形"},{"label":"D","text":"圆形"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"从正上方往下看正方体，看到的是它的顶面——一个正方形。","hint":"正方体每个面都是什么形状？","time_limit_seconds":20,"points":10,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_567","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":3,"grade_max":5,"difficulty":2,"tags":["logic","spatial","积木阴影"],"subject":"logic","stem":"一个球在阳光下的影子（地面上）是什么形状？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"圆形"},{"label":"B","text":"正方形"},{"label":"C","text":"椭圆形"},{"label":"D","text":"三角形"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"当光线斜照时球的影子是椭圆形。只有光从正上方照射时影子才是圆形。日常生活中太阳斜照居多，所以球的影子通常是椭圆形。","hint":"想想太阳通常从什么角度照射。","time_limit_seconds":30,"points":10,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_568","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":4,"grade_max":6,"difficulty":2,"tags":["logic","spatial","积木阴影"],"subject":"logic","stem":"3个正方体积木叠成L形（2个竖着1个旁边），从正面看是什么形状？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"L形"},{"label":"B","text":"正方形"},{"label":"C","text":"长方形"},{"label":"D","text":"取决于L的朝向"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"从正面看L形积木，如果L的弯折部分朝向你就能看到L形；如果L的弯折部分向侧面延伸，正面看可能是长方形。所以取决于L形的朝向。","hint":"想象从不同角度看L形积木。","time_limit_seconds":45,"points":10,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_569","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":5,"grade_max":7,"difficulty":3,"tags":["logic","spatial","积木阴影"],"subject":"logic","stem":"一个圆柱体从正前方看是什么形状？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"圆形"},{"label":"B","text":"长方形"},{"label":"C","text":"椭圆形"},{"label":"D","text":"梯形"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"圆柱体从正前方（侧面）看是一个长方形。从上方看是圆形。从侧面看到的是圆柱的高和直径组成的长方形。","hint":"想想一个易拉罐从正面看是什么样。","time_limit_seconds":30,"points":10,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_570","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":6,"grade_max":8,"difficulty":4,"tags":["logic","spatial","积木阴影"],"subject":"logic","stem":"一个物体从正面看是圆形，从侧面看也是圆形，从上面看还是圆形。这个物体最可能是？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"正方体"},{"label":"B","text":"圆柱体"},{"label":"C","text":"球体"},{"label":"D","text":"圆锥体"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"只有球体从任何角度看都是圆形。圆柱体从上面看是圆但从侧面看是长方形。圆锥从侧面看是三角形。正方体从任何正面看都是正方形。","hint":"什么物体从每个方向看形状都一样？","time_limit_seconds":30,"points":15,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_571","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":7,"grade_max":9,"difficulty":5,"tags":["logic","spatial","积木阴影"],"subject":"logic","stem":"一个物体正视图是正方形，侧视图是三角形，俯视图是圆形。这个物体存在吗？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"不存在"},{"label":"B","text":"存在"},{"label":"C","text":"取决于大小"},{"label":"D","text":"信息不足"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"这样的物体确实存在。它可以通过对一个圆柱体进行切割得到——想象一个半圆柱体经过特殊切割。三维空间中可以构造满足任意三个正交投影的物体（只要投影互相兼容）。","hint":"三维空间中的物体可以在不同方向呈现不同的形状。","time_limit_seconds":60,"points":20,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_572","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":2,"grade_max":4,"difficulty":1,"tags":["logic","spatial","镜面反射"],"subject":"logic","stem":"你站在镜子前举起右手，镜子中的你举起的是哪只手？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"右手"},{"label":"B","text":"左手"},{"label":"C","text":"两只都举"},{"label":"D","text":"都没举"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"镜子会左右颠倒。你举右手，镜中的像举的是左手。这就是镜面反射的左右翻转效果。","hint":"镜子会把左右颠倒。","time_limit_seconds":20,"points":10,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_573","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":3,"grade_max":5,"difficulty":2,"tags":["logic","spatial","镜面反射"],"subject":"logic","stem":"把字母'b'放在镜子前面，镜子中看到的是什么？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"b"},{"label":"B","text":"d"},{"label":"C","text":"p"},{"label":"D","text":"q"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"镜子左右翻转：b的竖线在左边、圆在右边，镜像后变成竖线在右边、圆在左边，就是'd'。","hint":"想象把字母b水平翻转。","time_limit_seconds":30,"points":10,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_574","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":4,"grade_max":6,"difficulty":2,"tags":["logic","spatial","镜面反射"],"subject":"logic","stem":"救护车前面的'AMBULANCE'（救护车）为什么是反着写的？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"印刷错误"},{"label":"B","text":"为了让前方车辆通过后视镜看到正确的字"},{"label":"C","text":"外国文字就是反着写的"},{"label":"D","text":"为了装饰好看"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"救护车前方的字反着写，这样前方车辆通过后视镜看到的就是正确的'AMBULANCE'。后视镜是镜面反射，会左右翻转，反着写的字经过镜面翻转后就变正了。","hint":"后视镜会把字翻转。","time_limit_seconds":30,"points":10,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_575","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":5,"grade_max":7,"difficulty":3,"tags":["logic","spatial","镜面反射"],"subject":"logic","stem":"两面平行镜子面对面放置，中间放一支蜡烛。理论上能产生多少个像？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"2个"},{"label":"B","text":"4个"},{"label":"C","text":"无数个"},{"label":"D","text":"0个"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"两面平行镜子面对面时，每面镜子都会反射对方镜子中的像，产生'像的像的像...'无限递归。理论上会产生无数个越来越小的像，排列成一条线。","hint":"一面镜子里的像会被另一面镜子再次反射。","time_limit_seconds":30,"points":15,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_576","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":6,"grade_max":8,"difficulty":4,"tags":["logic","spatial","镜面反射"],"subject":"logic","stem":"两面镜子成90度角放置，你站在角平分线上。你能看到自己的几个像？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"1个"},{"label":"B","text":"2个"},{"label":"C","text":"3个"},{"label":"D","text":"4个"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"两面镜子成θ角时，像的数量=360/θ-1。90度时：360/90-1=3个像。60度时：360/60-1=5个像。这就是万花筒的原理。","hint":"两面镜子的夹角越小，像越多。","time_limit_seconds":45,"points":15,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_577","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":7,"grade_max":9,"difficulty":4,"tags":["logic","spatial","镜面反射"],"subject":"logic","stem":"时钟放在镜子前，镜中时钟显示的时间是1:50。实际时间是几点？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"10:10"},{"label":"B","text":"11:10"},{"label":"C","text":"10:50"},{"label":"D","text":"1:50"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"镜中时钟左右翻转。实际时间=12:00-镜中时间(当镜中时间<12:00时)或24:00-镜中时间。1:50的镜像：12:00-1:50=10:10。","hint":"用12:00减去镜中的时间。","time_limit_seconds":60,"points":15,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_578","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":2,"grade_max":4,"difficulty":1,"tags":["logic","spatial","俯视图"],"subject":"logic","stem":"从上往下看一个杯子（俯视），看到的形状最接近？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"一个圆（杯口）"},{"label":"B","text":"一个长方形"},{"label":"C","text":"一个三角形"},{"label":"D","text":"一个梯形"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"从正上方看杯子，看到的是杯口的圆形。如果杯子有把手，可能会多出一个小突起，但主要形状是圆形。","hint":"从上面看一个杯子会看到什么？","time_limit_seconds":20,"points":10,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_579","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":3,"grade_max":5,"difficulty":2,"tags":["logic","spatial","俯视图"],"subject":"logic","stem":"从上方看一个金字塔形状（四棱锥），看到的形状是？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"三角形"},{"label":"B","text":"正方形加对角线"},{"label":"C","text":"圆形"},{"label":"D","text":"正方形"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"四棱锥从上方看，能看到底面的正方形轮廓，以及从顶点到四个角的棱线（看起来像正方形的两条对角线）。","hint":"底面是什么形状？从上面还能看到从尖顶到四角的线吗？","time_limit_seconds":30,"points":10,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_580","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":4,"grade_max":6,"difficulty":2,"tags":["logic","spatial","俯视图"],"subject":"logic","stem":"两个正方体积木并排放在桌上，从上方看是什么形状？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"一个正方形"},{"label":"B","text":"一个长方形（1:2的比例）"},{"label":"C","text":"两个分开的正方形"},{"label":"D","text":"L形"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"两个正方体并排放置，从上方看到两个正方形拼在一起，形成一个长宽比为2:1的长方形。","hint":"把两个正方形拼在一起是什么形状？","time_limit_seconds":30,"points":10,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_581","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":5,"grade_max":7,"difficulty":3,"tags":["logic","spatial","俯视图"],"subject":"logic","stem":"一个甜甜圈（圆环面体）从正上方看是什么形状？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"一个圆形"},{"label":"B","text":"两个同心圆（圆环）"},{"label":"C","text":"一个椭圆"},{"label":"D","text":"一个长方形"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"甜甜圈从正上方看，外圈是外圆，中间的孔是内圆，整体看起来是两个同心圆组成的圆环形状。","hint":"甜甜圈中间有个洞。","time_limit_seconds":30,"points":10,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_582","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":6,"grade_max":8,"difficulty":4,"tags":["logic","spatial","俯视图"],"subject":"logic","stem":"一个正四面体（4个等边三角形面）从正上方看是什么形状？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"等边三角形"},{"label":"B","text":"正方形"},{"label":"C","text":"圆形"},{"label":"D","text":"六边形"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"正四面体从正上方看（从一个顶点正上方向下看），看到的是底面的等边三角形轮廓。顶点的投影落在三角形的重心位置。","hint":"正四面体的底面是什么形状？","time_limit_seconds":30,"points":15,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_583","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":7,"grade_max":9,"difficulty":5,"tags":["logic","spatial","俯视图"],"subject":"logic","stem":"7个单位正方体搭成的L形积木（底层4个一排，第二层在最左边叠3个），俯视图的面积是多少个单位正方形？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"4"},{"label":"B","text":"7"},{"label":"C","text":"5"},{"label":"D","text":"6"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"俯视图只看到最顶层在各位置的覆盖。底层4个一排，上面3个叠在最左边。从上方看：最左边1列有覆盖(不管叠几层只占1格俯视面积)，右边3格底层。俯视图面积=4个单位正方形。","hint":"俯视图不管叠了几层，只看每个位置有没有东西。","time_limit_seconds":60,"points":20,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_584","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":2,"grade_max":4,"difficulty":1,"tags":["logic","spatial","路线最短"],"subject":"logic","stem":"从A到B走网格路，只能向右或向下。网格是2×2（2行2列），最短路线有几条？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"2条"},{"label":"B","text":"4条"},{"label":"C","text":"6条"},{"label":"D","text":"8条"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"2×2网格从左上到右下需要走2步右+2步下=4步。从4步中选2步向右的组合数=C(4,2)=6条。","hint":"每条最短路线都是走2步向右和2步向下的不同排列。","time_limit_seconds":45,"points":10,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_585","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":3,"grade_max":5,"difficulty":2,"tags":["logic","spatial","路线最短"],"subject":"logic","stem":"从家到学校，走街道网格只能向东或向北。向东3个路口，向北2个路口。最短路线有几条？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"6条"},{"label":"B","text":"10条"},{"label":"C","text":"15条"},{"label":"D","text":"20条"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"需要走3步东+2步北=5步。从5步中选2步向北（或3步向东）：C(5,2)=10条。","hint":"总共走5步，其中2步向北，不同的安排方式有几种？","time_limit_seconds":60,"points":10,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_586","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":4,"grade_max":6,"difficulty":3,"tags":["logic","spatial","路线最短"],"subject":"logic","stem":"3×3网格（从左上角到右下角），最短路线的总步数是多少？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"4步"},{"label":"B","text":"5步"},{"label":"C","text":"6步"},{"label":"D","text":"9步"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"3×3网格意味着需要向右走3步、向下走3步，总共6步。最短路线不能绕路，只能一直朝目标方向走。","hint":"向右几步？向下几步？加起来。","time_limit_seconds":30,"points":10,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_587","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":5,"grade_max":7,"difficulty":3,"tags":["logic","spatial","路线最短"],"subject":"logic","stem":"3×3网格从左上到右下的最短路线有多少条？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"6条"},{"label":"B","text":"10条"},{"label":"C","text":"20条"},{"label":"D","text":"30条"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"需要走3右+3下=6步。C(6,3)=6!/(3!×3!)=720/(6×6)=20条。","hint":"C(6,3)=6×5×4/(3×2×1)。","time_limit_seconds":60,"points":15,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_588","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":6,"grade_max":8,"difficulty":4,"tags":["logic","spatial","路线最短"],"subject":"logic","stem":"如果网格中间有一个障碍物不能通过，还能用什么方法计算最短路线数？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"总路线数减去经过障碍的路线数"},{"label":"B","text":"无法计算"},{"label":"C","text":"路线数不变"},{"label":"D","text":"除以2"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"有障碍物的最短路线数=不考虑障碍的总路线数-经过障碍点的路线数。经过障碍点的路线数=从起点到障碍的路线数×从障碍到终点的路线数。这叫减法原理。","hint":"从总数中减去不合法的。","time_limit_seconds":45,"points":15,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"},
  {"id":"logic_q_589","module":"logic","type":"question","subtype":"choice","grade_min":7,"grade_max":9,"difficulty":5,"tags":["logic","spatial","路线最短"],"subject":"logic","stem":"4×4网格从左上到右下的最短路线有多少条？","options":[{"label":"A","text":"35条"},{"label":"B","text":"56条"},{"label":"C","text":"70条"},{"label":"D","text":"120条"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"需要4右+4下=8步。C(8,4)=8!/(4!×4!)=70条。也可以用杨辉三角逐格计算：每个格子的路线数=上方格子+左方格子的路线数之和。","hint":"C(8,4)=8×7×6×5/(4×3×2×1)。","time_limit_seconds":60,"points":20,"version":1,"created_at":"2026-03-27","updated_at":"2026-03-27"}
]
